{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにリクエストしても良い?俺あしゅりんも好きやねんけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんとのツーショット撮ってブログにのしてくれへん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい(^^)/\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエストにお答えして、あしゅー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事行ってきました＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに会うの久しぶりな気がするよー全握おらんかったけえね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近々、何らかの形でひめたん登場しますーお楽しみに♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケート回答ありがとうございます(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこで生まれたのー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病院ー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなん知っとるわ!わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいねーいろんなエピソードまでご丁寧にありがとーう(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにひめたんはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"市電の見える広島の病院で生まれたのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままいわく、春のあったかい日(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー広島懐かしいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週行くからねーみんな待っとってーな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃ今日の質問。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.ひとりっこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.長子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.中間子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.末っ子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたはどーれ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにひめたんは3の中間子。姉さんと妹がおるよー＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは習い事始めるなら何がしたい??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お料理教室(*^^*)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あっぷのためにねー大事だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインとか、毎年超ラッピングにこだわって超可愛くしてみるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際凝ったもの作れない子、クラスにおらんかったー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな子おったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんもご両親や周りの感謝してますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんもちろん(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんはいろんな人にお世話になって、迷惑かけたからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって楽しくアイドルできるのも、こうやって楽しく高校生できるのも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族やみなさんのサポートのおかげなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、恥ずかしいから、いつも感謝してるって言ったりしない...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うし。この場を借りて改めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとーうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張ります(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のひめたんのマイブームはなに?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ジムに行ってみたのー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが楽しくて(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビでよく見るトレーニングマシンがいっぱい使えるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決めた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏はジム通う!筋肉むきむきのまっちょアイドルになってやるー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの周りに双子の知り合いおる?笑っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういや身近にはおらんかもー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年子ちゃんならよく聞きますけれどもね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子のメーカーで好きなのはある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこれいとーはーめっいーじ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶっちゃけお菓子なら何でも好き(*^^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは広島おるとき[とうかさん]行ってたー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ってたならとうかさんエピソード教えてくださいなp(^-^)q"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうかさん毎年行っとったよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の子はみんなとうかさんで浴衣解禁するの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいなーとうかさん行きたくなってきた!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋台でぜったい食べるのある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てっぱんだけど、かき氷ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご味ね。シロップ多めで練乳があるとなおテンション上がる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはいっつもりんごあめ買うんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局食べきれんで最後誰かにあげるー('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"獅子舞わかる?でたことある?(゜_゜>)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"獅子舞わかるけど、見たことあるけど、で、でるー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"獅子舞の中に人なんていなーいわら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...いやあーかっくいいですよねー獅子舞。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭とか重たそう('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元日芽香＆伊藤万理華コンビのコンビ名を考えるとしたら何?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「なかいさん」。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命名:ねねころ(伊藤寧々chan)、マネージャーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/04/3846947/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近乃木坂メンバー内で流行っていることは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「くたばれ(*'ω`*)」て超可愛くいう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいくね。がちで言っちゃだめだよ?ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここのあしゅりん(齋藤飛鳥chan)風ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}